# Phase 5: Smoke test before running all records

First run approximately 5 records.

Include:

* at least one known ultimately included study;
* at least one clearly irrelevant study if possible;
* several ordinary records.

Print:

```text
title
actual final inclusion label
Jev probability
```

Check that:

* the SDK call works;
* the Noul value is a number between 0 and 1;
* the intended direction is correct: higher probability = more reason to retain;
* no labels are leaking into the Jev state or question.

Only then run the full dataset.

