# Phase 7: Evaluate Jev

The central metric is NOT overall accuracy.

Because systematic-review screening prioritises avoiding missed relevant studies, focus on:

* recall/sensitivity;
* false negatives;
* workload reduction.

Define:

```text
recall =
included studies retained /
all ultimately included studies
```

Define:

```text
workload reduction =
records Jev would automatically exclude /
all records
```

For several fixed thresholds, for example:

```text
0.10
0.20
0.30
0.40
0.50
0.60
0.70
0.80
0.90
```

calculate:

```text
threshold
true positives
false negatives
true negatives
false positives
recall
specificity
precision
number retained for human screening
number automatically excluded
workload reduction %
```

Save:

```text
outputs/threshold_results.csv
```

