# Interpretation rules

Do not write marketing conclusions such as:

```text
Jev can safely automate systematic-review screening.
```

This experiment alone cannot establish that.

Acceptable conclusions include:

```text
In this single retrospective dataset, Jev could separate many eventually
excluded records from the ultimately included studies.
```

or, if performance is poor:

```text
Once 100% recall was required, Jev provided little useful workload reduction.
```

The experiment is exploratory and retrospective.

Do not generalise beyond this review.

